      "source": "An <code>ArtifactsFilter</code> that filters by matching groupId.\n\nPreferred over the\n<code>GroupIdFilter</code> due to that\nclasses use of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html#startsWith(java.lang.String,int)\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String.startsWith(String, int)</code></a> to match on prefix.",
